msgid "Configuring DNSmasq"
msgstr "የ DNSmasq ማሰናጃ"

#: ../ltsp-live:222
msgid "Starting DNSmasq"
msgstr "የ DNSmasq በማስጀመር ላይ"

#: ../ltsp-live:229
msgid "Extracting thin client kernel and initrd"
msgstr "በ ማራገፍ ላይ thin client kernel and initrd"

#: ../ltsp-live:255
msgid "Starting NBD server"
msgstr "የ NBD ሰርቨር በማስጀመር ላይ"

#: ../ltsp-live:261 ../ltsp-live:353
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "ዝግጁ"

#: ../ltsp-live:316
msgid "None"
msgstr "ምንም"

#: ../ltsp-live:358
msgid "LTSP-Live should now be ready to use!"
msgstr "የ LTSP-Live አሁን ለ መጠቀም ዝግጁ ነው!"

#: ../ltsp-live:368
msgid "Unable to configure Network Manager"
msgstr "የ ኔትዎርክ አስተዳዳሪ ማሰናዳት አልተቻለም"

#: ../ltsp-live:388
msgid ""
"The selected network interface is already in use.\n"
"Are you sure you want to use it?"
msgstr ""
"የ ተመረጠውን የ ኔትዎርክ ገጽታ እየተጠቀሙበት ነው\n"
"በ እርግጥ እርስዎ ሊጠቀሙበት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: ../ltsp-live.xml:6
msgid "LTSP-Live configuration"
msgstr "የ LTSP-Live ማሰናጃ"

#: ../ltsp-live.xml:21
msgid ""
"Welcome to LTSP Live.\n"
"Please choose a network interface below and click OK."
msgstr ""
"እንኳን ደህና መጡ ወደ LTSP Live.\n"
"እባክዎን የ ኔትዎርክ ገጽታ ይምረጡ ከ ታች በኩል እና ይጫኑ እሺ"

