msgstr "የ LTSP-Live ማስጀመሪያ"

#: ../ltsp-live.desktop
msgid "Starts an LTSP server from the live CD"
msgstr "የ LTSP ሰርቨር ማስጀመሪያ ከ live ሲዲ ውስጥ"
